dsh-apk-vm README · Storage management：`GET /apk-vm/storage` reports the logical size of every AVD, its quick-boot snapshots, the
Android SDK, plugin temp files and the free space on the AVD volume. The panel's **Storage**
card uses the same endpoint.

`POST /apk-vm/storage` accepts:

```json
{ "action": "temp" }
{ "action": "snapshots", "avdName": "dsh_apk", "confirm": true }
{ "action": "orphan-avds", "confirm": true }
```

dsh-apk-vm README · Network controls：`GET /apk-vm/network` returns the guest addresses, current proxy, DNS, hosts count, mode,
port forwards and pcap status. `POST /apk-vm/network` accepts `action`:

```json
{ "action": "mode", "mode": "isolated|shared" }
{ "action": "forward-add", "localPort": 18080, "remotePort": 8080, "shared": false }
{ "action": "forward-remove", "localPort": 18080 }
{ "action": "dns", "servers": ["1.1.1.1"] }

dsh-apk-vm README · Automated checks (CI)：- `node --check` on `index.js`, `client.js` and every `lib/*.js` module;
- [spike/ui-smoke.cjs](spike/ui-smoke.cjs) — 136 sandbox assertions against the real client
  bundle (module wrapper, registration, i18n, rendering states, POST handlers);
- [spike/ui-better-sidebar-smoke.cjs](spike/ui-better-sidebar-smoke.cjs) — descriptor /
  localization / disposal / fallback assertions for the optional integration;
- [spike/setup-smoke.mjs](spike/setup-smoke.mjs) — 30 hermetic environment-detection /
  create-avd / install-image / setup-report checks (mocked OS layouts and `exec`, no SDK needed);
- [spike/android/mock-device.mjs](spike/android/mock-device.mjs) — device critical path against
  a mock adb (24 checks), including real `aapt2` APK metadata parsing;
- [spike/android/launch-plan.mjs](spike/android/launch-plan.mjs) — fast-boot argv plans
  (snapshot restore, fail-fast without a hypervisor, explicit TCG, `-no-snapshot`).
